 data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> are object-level models. The witness and universal comparison use the exact five-place forcing-setup signature, including its theory parameter.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-forcing.md","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ and $M[G]_P\\in V$ (see [[../batch15/58-df-forcing.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"d,M,N,\\Gamma,P,R,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ForcingSetup}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]_P\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGeologyForcingDegree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\